WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.380
Setup: shifts, stations, posts, and point people.

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.471
Pick a day, or add one with plus Day.

00:00:07.671 --> 00:00:17.320
Add a shift: pick a station or type a new one, then the times, spots, and who can sign up. Check the box to add it at every time slot that day.

00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:24.770
Below that, every station lists its posts, its point person, and its shifts, with Edit on each one.

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:34.069
Edit changes the times, spots, who can sign up, how much it counts, and the status. If you move a time, the families on it get an email.

00:00:34.269 --> 00:00:42.220
Who can sign up: anyone, H S and adults, H S students only, adults, or assigned by the coordinators.

00:00:43.070 --> 00:00:51.668
Posts split a station into jobs, like buses or directors. Add one with plus post. Then pick each person's post on the day grid.

00:00:51.868 --> 00:00:55.830
Plus point person adds the person running that station.

00:00:56.680 --> 00:01:06.250
All the point people are listed at the bottom. Email link sends them the link to their page. Homeroom coordinators placed on a shift show up here too.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.750
Next: families.
